# Root .gitignore — this repo had NONE before 5 Sep 2026.
# The nested Build/dwci-platform-foundation/.gitignore already protects that
# folder's .env; these rules cover the repo root and anything added later.

# Secrets — never commit. .env.example (placeholders only) is kept.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets.json

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build OUTPUT only.
# NOTE: a bare "build/" rule is NOT used here on purpose. core.ignorecase is
# true on this machine, so "build/" also matches "Build/" — the folder that
# holds dwci-platform-foundation, which is SOURCE, not output. That rule
# silently hid 63 real files when first written on 5 Sep 2026.
/dist/
.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo

# OS and editor noise (this repo lives under OneDrive)
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CP-113 — THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC (.repo-visibility = public, verified 2 Sep
# 2026: it loads to an unauthenticated fetch). The folders below are INTERNAL
# analysis and are excluded so that a stray `git add .` cannot publish them by
# adjacency -- the exact failure CP-113 exists to prevent.
#
# These are NOT ignored because they are junk. They are business-critical and
# belong in a PRIVATE repository. Excluding them here is a stopgap, not the fix.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Strategy & Documentation/
Skills & Certifications/
*_Plan_2026-*.xlsx
